[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4564253428","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119785#issuecomment-4564253428","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119785","id":4564253428,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEAz69A","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-28T13:07:11Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T13:07:11Z","body":"Hello! May I ask if you could check if this issue is reproducible with SDL's `testcontroller` application, please? \n[testcontroller.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28311485/testcontroller.zip)\nBefore running `testcontroller` file there, you should run `export LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$LD_LIBRARY_PATH:./`, so the system can find the SDL library file.\n\nI got the files from the official SDL repository's GitHub Actions ( https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL/actions/runs/26483611060 )\nfrom the file called `SDL-ubuntu-latest`.\n\nIf it is reproducible, may I ask if you could create a mapping for your controller? Testcontroller allows to do that, and it will let you copy it!",