tton 0`\n- SL => shown as `East`/`Button 2`\n- SR => shown as `North`/`Button 3`\n\nSDL recognises both controllers as `Nintendo Switch Joy-Con (R)` for some reason.\nI hope that helps. :)\n\nSo it seems reproducible to me. I'll try to create a mapping but it will probably take a bit.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4564478344/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4564517024","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119785#issuecomment-4564517024","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119785","id":4564517024,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEBEAoA","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-28T13:37:39Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T13:39:57Z","body":"Great! May I also ask if you could print the name of the controllers by using `print(Input.get_joy_name(